        "content": "The system runs on specialization, not generalist reps.\n\n- **Sales development rep (SDR):** generates new opportunities. Prospects into cold or inactive accounts.\n- **Account executive (AE):** closes business. Re-qualifies and works opportunities the SDR passes over.\n\nOne rep switching between prospecting and closing mindsets in the same day loses efficiency. Splitting the roles is what makes both faster.\n\nRatio: one SDR can typically support 2 to 5 AEs. The larger the deal size, the smaller the ratio."
